<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>About Us | Green Parrot Solutions</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Green Parrot Solutions helps businesses build their brand, grow their digital presence and turn leads into customers." />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/responsive.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/components.css" />
</head>
<body>

  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <section class="hero" style="padding-top: 150px; padding-bottom: 60px;">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Us</p>
      <h1 class="hero-heading" style="max-width: 700px;">
        We Don't Just Market Businesses.<br />
        We Build Their <span class="text-green">Digital Growth.</span>
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <div>
        <p style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text);">
          Green Parrot Solutions helps businesses turn ideas into digital
          experiences, powerful marketing campaigns and scalable systems —
          from a first website, to a brand identity, to the CRM that keeps
          every lead from falling through the cracks.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>
          We work across strategy, creative, and technology — because real
          growth rarely comes from just one of those alone. Whether it's
          building your website, running your ad campaigns, managing your
          social presence, or automating how your team handles leads, our
          goal is the same: measurable, long-term growth for your business.
        </p>
        <ul class="about-pillars">
          <li>Strategy</li>
          <li>Creativity</li>
          <li>Technology</li>
          <li>Growth</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="why-us">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Why Businesses Choose<br />Green Parrot Solutions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="why-grid">
        <div class="why-card">
          <span class="why-num">01</span>
          <h3>One Growth Partner</h3>
          <p>Marketing, technology and creative solutions under one roof.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <span class="why-num">02</span>
          <h3>Strategy First</h3>
          <p>We build solutions around your actual business goals.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <span class="why-num">03</span>
          <h3>Creative + Technology</h3>
          <p>Creative ideas powered by modern technology.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <span class="why-num">04</span>
          <h3>Results Focused</h3>
          <p>We focus on measurable business growth.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="final-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to Grow Your Business?</h2>
      <p>Let's turn your ideas into a digital growth system.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start Your Journey &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <%- include('partials/floatingButtons') %>

  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
